# 🛡️ Global Risk Prediction Manifest (Unified Repository Version)

# 1. 🛑 Block massive data files (Gigabyte scale)
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
**/*.zip
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.h5

# 2. 🛑 Block specific data folders (To be safe)
lending_club/data/
universal_historian/data/

# 3. 🛑 Block metadata and temporary files
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# 4. 🛑 Block MoneyViz (Mandatory: Do NOT Push)
**/moneyviz_surrogate/

# 5. ✅ ALLOW ALL Machine Learning Artifacts (User Request)
# The following will NOT be ignored:
!**/*.pkl
!**/*.png
!**/*.txt

# 6. ✅ ALLOW ALL Source Code and Documentation
!**/*.py
!**/*.md
!.gitignore

# 7. ✅ ALLOW Project Model/Output Structures
!**/outputs/
!**/models/
!**/plots/
!**/reports/
